Subject: [PATCH 1230/3799] soh: rename func_80096F6C -> Room_DrawImage

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the in-tree comment above it reads "Room Draw Polygon Type 1"; it is sRoomDrawHandlers[1] and dispatches on the polygon's format to the single- or multi-image drawer. Named to match the file's Room_DrawNormal and Room_DrawCullable.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_room.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_room.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

